<title>LEBANON: Bank of Lebanon issues CDs worth 14 bln pounds.</title>
<headline>Bank of Lebanon issues CDs worth 14 bln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lebanon issued on Thursday 60-day certificates of deposit dated April 11 to commercial banks worth 14 billion Lebanese pounds.</p>
<p>The CDs carry 12.75 percent annual interest. The bank made no sales of 45-day CDs at 12 percent for the second week.</p>
<p>Last week the bank sold 60-day CDs worth 71 billion pounds.</p>
<p>($1 = 1,545 Lebanese pounds)</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 602057 345740 745308</p>
